- Demand for each branch:
  - d_C1 = 143
  - d_C2 = 6
  - d_C3 = 10
  - d_C4 = 25
  - d_C5 = 3

- Transportation costs c_{ij} (cost per unit from supplier i to branch j):

|        | C1      | C2      | C3      | C4      | C5      |
|--------|---------|---------|---------|---------|---------|
| S1     | 150.74  | 0.02    | 49.13   | 2080.15 | 426.40  |
| S2     | 233.05  | 97.73   | 49.84   | 1982.39 | 23.96   |
